OL,3,GNEWSALegally Blonde 'inspired the kind
OL,4,Aof lawyer I wanted to be'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been 25 years since Elle Woods
OL,7,Fstomped her 'last season Prada shoes'
OL,8,Facross UK screens in Legally Blonde.
OL,10,FThe film, which was released 25 years
OL,11,Fago today, saw Woods - played by Reese
OL,12,FWitherspoon - enrol in Harvard Law
OL,13,FSchool after her boyfriend dumps her
OL,14,Ffor not being serious enough. The film
OL,15,Fwent on to inspire generations of
OL,16,Fwould-be lawyers and solicitors.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
