OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALegally Blonde 'inspired the kind
OL,4,Aof lawyer I wanted to be'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA quarter of a century later, women now
OL,7,Foutnumber men in the legal industry -
OL,8,Fand while "the Legally Blonde effect"
OL,9,Fmay not be the sole reason for the
OL,10,Fboost, those in the profession have
OL,11,Fsaid it has not hurt the cause.
OL,13,F"It definitely inspired the kind of
OL,14,Flawyer I wanted to be," trainee
OL,15,Fsolicitor Olivia Holder said.
